    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Where you are from",
     "texto": [
      "**Woher kommst du?** means «where are you from?» (with «Sie»: **Woher kommen Sie?**).",
      "You answer **Ich komme aus Spanien** (I come from Spain). **Aus** means «from», for origin.",
      "Nationality is a **noun**, written with a capital letter and without an article. It has a masculine and a feminine form, and the feminine usually adds **-in**: **Ich bin Spanier** (I am Spanish, said by a man), **Ich bin Spanierin** (I am Spanish, said by a woman)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
